      "description": "Check that `AtomicMass.lean` is still in sync with the data table it is generated from: the job regenerates and diffs, and any difference fails.\n\nThe check itself is the shared `generated-file-drift` process (Process_GeneratedFileDrift), drawn once for every drift check. Its workflow's job names Start_Change (`# bpmn-node:`), which is how check:workflow-coverage sees the job.",
